{"id":"n14380-1-8","stage":2,"title":"데우다 · 热","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14380-1-8-1","ko":"밥 식으니까 빨리 와서 먹으렴.","zh":"饭都凉了，快过来吃吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밥","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}},{"text":"식으니까","meaning":"凉","explanation":"식다：凉；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"식다","audio":"/audio/6ae572e959621a79ba3c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30204","senseId":"1","lemma":"식다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식으니까","audio":"/audio/7d9701183d83622ee1cd.mp3"}},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"먹으렴.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹으렴","audio":"/audio/42e757c5c7deb301bef6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭，餐","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"每天在一定时间吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"6ae572e959621a79","term":"식다","zh":"凉","audio":"/audio/6ae572e959621a79ba3c.mp3","entryId":"30204","definition":"热气消退。","pronunciation":["식따"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/da1526d44950b53fc929.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14380-1-8-2","ko":"지금 할 일이 있어요. 나중에 데워서 먹을게요.","zh":"我现在有事情要做，稍后会把饭加热了再吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","audio":"/audio/deca3bc3889d43a361ec.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}},{"text":"나중에","meaning":"后来，以后","explanation":"나중：后来，以后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나중","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62275","senseId":"1","lemma":"나중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나중에","audio":"/audio/a12252500035668f76c9.mp3"}},{"text":"데워서","meaning":"热，温，暖","explanation":"데우다：热，温，暖；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"데우다","audio":"/audio/80b498ba41d9194c8dcd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14380","senseId":"1","lemma":"데우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"데워서","audio":"/audio/7265ee72b9e450046c96.mp3"}},{"text":"먹을게요.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹을게요","audio":"/audio/18b8dd0c0c92106416e4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b8922cba892bea4a","term":"나중","zh":"后来，以后","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3","entryId":"62275","definition":"一定的时间过后。","pronunciation":["나ː중"]},{"id":"80b498ba41d9194c","term":"데우다","zh":"热，温，暖","audio":"/audio/80b498ba41d9194c8dcd.mp3","entryId":"14380","definition":"使冷的东西变温热。","pronunciation":["데우다"]},{"id":